  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Suffocate",
  "display_fullname": "Dominator Control Water Control Suffocate",
  "display_help": "You trap your foe in a watery sphere causing them to helplessly gasp for air. While affected by this power your target will suffer Moderate Cold damage over time, be rendered Held and be unable to attack and have reduced defense for a short time. This power has a moderate chance to place the Drowning effect on its target. Suffocate deals additional damage and has improved movement speed reduction against foes suffering from Drowning. Damage: Moderate DoT, Recharge: Moderate",
